  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5f4250c7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. Pretrained DeiT-Small + PoPE Attention Swap\n",
    "\n",
    "Same DeiT-Small backbone (pretrained on ImageNet), but every attention layer is replaced with\n",
    "`PoPEAttention` before fine-tuning.  The QKV and output-projection weights are copied from the\n",
    "original pretrained attention, so the backbone representations are warm-started.\n",
    "\n",
    "This experiment isolates the **positional encoding contribution**: pretrained backbone identical,\n",
    "only the attention mechanism differs between Section 9 and Section 10."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 157,
   "id": "bca51331",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
